          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.692,
            0.778,
            0.712
          ],
          "content": "So, 1324 ÷ 4 = 0 Thousands + 3 Hundreds + 3 Tens + 1 Ones = 331."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.716,
            0.755,
            0.738
          ],
          "content": "We also call this division using place values as ‘**long division**’."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.759,
            0.556,
            0.781
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Division with a Decimal Quotient"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.786,
            0.848,
            0.824
          ],
          "content": "Now, let us use this understanding of long division to find the value of $1 3 2 5 \\div 4 .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
